      "message": "Why not add a helper function that locates a (valid) `\u0026CStr` from a slice and an offset (using `from_bytes_until_nul`), guaranteed to never OOB but removing the need to do fancy offset arithmetic at the call-site?\n\nYou could then validate that\n```\nlet _ \u003d get_cstr_at(buffer, compat_offset)?;\n```\nand also re-use it for the `vm_name` (b/382493676#comment8).",
