      "side": 1,
      "message": "If we allow a separate string table and reusing strings, then we won\u0027t have a way of of deriving `expected_len`. It\u0027s coming down to deciding how prescriptive we want to be in balacing just \"does it fit within the allocated space\" versus \"is it possible anything in here isn\u0027t what was intended?\"\n\nI think we\u0027re shifting toward the former.",
