      "writtenOn": "2025-02-12T15:45:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "What if the guest kernel has alignment constraints (e.g. `PAGE_SIZE`)? I thought that this change was going to copy the select blobs to dedicated distinct (guest) page-aligned regions before clearing the config data region. I agree that this implementation is faster (although missing the clearing) but am not convinced it\u0027s correct?",
